                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "do we need the extra variable here?  Just timer->propertiesChangedTimer at the call sites?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/entity_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 474,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Yes we need it to avoid the lambda from reformatting.\n\nCurrently we have\n```\ntimer.async_wait( ...\n```\nbut\n```\npropertiesChangedTimer.async_wait( ...\n```\n\nwould cause a different indentation for the whole lambda body."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/entity_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 474,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/entity_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 514,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "unrelated?  (looks like our famous lambda formatting mess)"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/entity_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 514,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Yes, looks unrelated, i should remove that diff.\n\nIt's a leftover from changing \n```timer``` to ```propertiesChangedTimer``` and back.\n\nThe alias is needed to avoid the lambda being completely reformatted and causing unrelated diff."
                },
                {
